{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"react","version":"v4","id":"typescript","title":"TypeScript","description":"What React Layout infers from your definitions and how to take types back out.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["React Layout is written in TypeScript. CI checks the published factory types on TypeScript 5.9 and 6. You rarely write type arguments: resource keys, option props, render state names and component names are inferred from your definitions."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"what-is-inferred"},"children":["What is inferred"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[["\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Resource keys."]}," The ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["resources"]}," list defines the allowed keys. Passing any other ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["resource"]}," is a type error. See ",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./guides/resource-layouts.md"},"children":["Resources and layouts"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Props."]}," Option and component-time props come from your schemas. Required props, including ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["children: 'required'"]},", are checked by TypeScript and at runtime. See ",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./guides/props-and-validation.md"},"children":["Props and validation"]},"."]]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Component names."]}," Without a ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["name"]},", resource ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["'users'"]}," generates ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["'UsersLayout'"]}," at runtime and as an exact TypeScript literal."]]},"\n",{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["Render state names."]}," Inline render maps infer the union of their declared state names. Independent ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["createRenderState"]}," definitions use ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["string"]},"; bind them with ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["createRenderState.forStates(...)"]},". See ",{"tag":"mdx:a","props":{"href":"./guides/render-states.md#derive-a-state"},"children":["Render states"]},"."]]},"\n"]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"take-a-type-from-a-definition"},"children":["Take a type from a definition"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["Use ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["getSchema(path)"]}," and read ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["infer"]}," to reuse a prop's value type elsewhere:"]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:pre","props":{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark twoslash lsp","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M14.23 12.004a2.236 2.236 0 0 1-2.235 2.236 2.236 2.236 0 0 1-2.236-2.236 2.236 2.236 0 0 1 2.235-2.236 2.236 2.236 0 0 1 2.236 2.236zm2.648-10.69c-1.346 0-3.107.96-4.888 2.622-1.78-1.653-3.542-2.602-4.887-2.602-.41 0-.783.093-1.106.278-1.375.793-1.683 3.264-.973 6.365C1.98 8.917 0 10.42 0 12.004c0 1.59 1.99 3.097 5.043 4.03-.704 3.113-.39 5.588.988 6.38.32.187.69.275 1.102.275 1.345 0 3.107-.96 4.888-2.624 1.78 1.654 3.542 2.603 4.887 2.603.41 0 .783-.09 1.106-.275 1.374-.792 1.683-3.263.973-6.365C22.02 15.096 24 13.59 24 12.004c0-1.59-1.99-3.097-5.043-4.032.704-3.11.39-5.587-.988-6.38-.318-.184-.688-.277-1.092-.278zm-.005 1.09v.006c.225 0 .406.044.558.127.666.382.955 1.835.73 3.704-.054.46-.142.945-.25 1.44-.96-.236-2.006-.417-3.107-.534-.66-.905-1.345-1.727-2.035-2.447 1.592-1.48 3.087-2.292 4.105-2.295zm-9.77.02c1.012 0 2.514.808 4.11 2.28-.686.72-1.37 1.537-2.02 2.442-1.107.117-2.154.298-3.113.538-.112-.49-.195-.964-.254-1.42-.23-1.868.054-3.32.714-3.707.19-.09.4-.127.563-.132zm4.882 3.05c.455.468.91.992 1.36 1.564-.44-.02-.89-.034-1.345-.034-.46 0-.915.01-1.36.034.44-.572.895-1.096 1.345-1.565zM12