ation with callback return inference inside reverse-mapped state entries."]]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"editor-suggestions-in-issubresourcekey"},"children":[["Editor suggestions in ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["isSubResourceKey"]}]]},"\n",{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":[["TypeScript 5.9 still offers root suggestions for the ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["path"]}," property inside ",{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":["isSubResourceKey"]}," options. TypeScript 6 follows the typed prefix. The complete path is validated either way."]]}],"toc":[{"title":"What is inferred","url":"#what-is-inferred","depth":2},{"title":"Take a type from a definition","url":"#take-a-type-from-a-definition","depth":2},{"title":"Let TypeScript infer","url":"#let-typescript-infer","depth":2},{"title":"Editor suggestions in isSubResourceKey","url":"#editor-suggestions-in-issubresourcekey","depth":2}]}